WEBVTT

00:14:28.166 --> 00:14:33.956
the culture is more like people
seem to want to be more separate,

00:14:33.980 --> 00:14:36.296
who is colleagues and who are friends.

00:14:36.320 --> 00:14:40.286
And so that feels a little bit isolating.

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:42.996
My name is Dr. Luz Claudio.

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:48.436
I'm an environmental health scientist
at Mount Sinai School of Medicine.

00:14:48.460 --> 00:14:51.926
AG: And what in the world
is an environmental health scientist?

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:56.106
LC: It's not like being in forest
and counting animals.

00:14:56.130 --> 00:15:02.776
It's more about, we can protect people
from environmental toxins.